  "description_short": "Modern family restaurant in central Knysna serving fresh, flavourful dishes in a relaxed setting.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Union Street in the heart of Knysna, Salt & Petal has become a favourite among locals and visitors alike. The restaurant strikes that rare balance between casual comfort and quality cooking, making it equally suited for a family lunch or a relaxed evening out with friends.\n\nThe menu leans towards modern comfort food with fresh, seasonal ingredients taking centre stage. Portions are generous without being overwhelming, and there's genuine care in the preparation. The space itself is warm and unpretentious, with friendly service that makes you feel welcome from the moment you walk in.\n\nLocated in Knysna Central, it's an easy stop whether you're exploring the town or looking for a reliable meal after a day on the lagoon. The consistently high ratings speak to a kitchen that delivers time and again, without the fuss or pretension that sometimes comes with popular spots.",
